    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Carroll are excited to bring No. 14 Seaview Way to the market For Sale! A stunning, superbly finished, 3 bedroom, semi detached home extending to 1,148 sq.ft. / 107 sq.m. approx with an A3 energy efficiency rating.\n\nThis home has been finished to an exceptionally high standard internally to give it a bright, relaxed and spacious feel throughout. Some features include 9 foot high ceilings, sliding pocket doors between the sitting room and kitchen, master bedroom with an en-suite, fully integrated German kitchen by Kube Interiors with all appliances, Danfoss air to water heating and hot water system, Vent-axia air filtration system, wall mounted TV points to kitchen and bedrooms, under stairs storage / cloaks and Stira stairs to attic area. \n\nExternally, the property benefits from off street parking, side pedestrian access and a manicured rear garden with patio. Also included in this wonderful home is the high speed fibre broadband and EV charging port.\n\nSeaview Way is perfectly positioned on an elevated site off the coast road leading to the picture-perfect promenade of Blackrock village where a variety of specialty shops, cafes, bars and restaurants are available. In addition, the property is also located next door to Dundalk Golf Club, a championship 18 hole links course with a fabulous restaurant and panoramic bar.\n\nBlackrock is located mid-way between Dublin and Belfast and is well connected and close to a huge array of amenities, including Dundalk Institute of Technology, the Marshes Shopping Centre, Dundalk Retail Park, IDA Business & Technology Parks and the MSD / WuXi Pharmaceutical facility. In addition, the property is convenient to M1 Mtorway Junction 16 providing links to both Dublin & Belfast city, ideal fro commuters or those on a hybrid working basis. \n\nA home truly worth viewing! Contact us today on 0429332173 to secure early viewing."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nGROUND FLOOR - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - \n\n\nSitting Room - 5.84m x 3.68m\n\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 5.80m x 4.46m\n\n\nUtility Room - 1.45m x 1.40m\n\n\nW.C. - 1.90m x 1.46m\n\n\nFIRST FLOOR - \n\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.80m x 4.13m\n\n\nEn-Suite - 2.12m x 1.51m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.17m x 1.79m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.99m x 2.93m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.99m x 2.87m\n\n\nHot Press - 1.12m x 0.91m\n\n\n - \nTOTAL FLOOR AREA: 1,147 sq.ft. (106.6 sq.m.) approx.\n\n"
      },
